WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.025 --> 00:00:03.689
♫ ["The End of the World"
performed by Skeeter Davis] ♫

00:00:06.881 --> 00:00:13.709
♫ Why does the sun
go on shining? ♫

00:00:13.709 --> 00:00:20.614
♫ Why does the sea
rush to shore? ♫

00:00:20.614 --> 00:00:24.392
♫ Don't they know
it's the end of the world? ♫

00:00:24.417 --> 00:00:27.193
[Distant rumbling]

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:31.413
♫ 'Cause you don't
love me anymore ♫

00:00:31.438 --> 00:00:32.685
SERSI
It's beautiful.

00:00:33.614 --> 00:00:34.521
Isn't it?

00:00:36.923 --> 00:00:40.305
[Music echoing]

00:00:44.545 --> 00:00:48.098
♪♪

00:00:49.981 --> 00:00:52.021
AJAK
We have watched...

00:00:53.396 --> 00:00:55.146
...and guided.

00:00:55.896 --> 00:00:58.062
We have helped them
progress,

00:01:00.396 --> 00:01:01.937
and seen them...

00:01:02.605 --> 00:01:05.240
...accomplish wonders.

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:07.454
♪♪

00:01:07.479 --> 00:01:09.428
AJAK
Throughout the years,

00:01:09.428 --> 00:01:11.979
we have never
interfered.

00:01:14.142 --> 00:01:17.286
Until now.

00:01:20.089 --> 00:01:22.266
♪♪

00:01:33.869 --> 00:01:41.643
♫ It ended when
you said goodbye ♫

00:01:49.789 --> 00:01:50.990
IKARIS
Thank you for this.

00:01:51.015 --> 00:01:51.784
GILGAMESH
Oh, you're welcome.

00:01:51.808 --> 00:01:53.271
SPRITE
So now that Captain Rogers and Iron Man

00:01:53.271 --> 00:01:55.892
are both gone, who do you
think's gonna lead the Avengers?

00:01:57.765 --> 00:01:59.101
IKARIS
I could lead them.

00:02:01.434 --> 00:02:03.767
[Laughing]

